# Health dashboard

- Rewrite stale sentences. Do not leave the September 2026 story (no pull requests, no workflows, July 30, duplicate volumes) if main has moved.
- Status color is `var(--margin)` and `var(--margin-soft)`. Do not invent `--red`.
- Hairlines use `var(--line)`. Do not add hex colors.
- A `.pill` holds exactly one word. Put the count in the pill and the label beside it.
- Summary cards use `repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 15rem), 1fr))`.
- Collapse the score hero to one column at `760px`, and set `background-attachment: scroll` at that width.
- Keep CSS in the page `<style>` block. Do not add a shared stylesheet.
- Do not edit `index.html` or the lesson HTML in the same change. Those files already have open drafts.
